    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 2.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 gilde se þe woh dide XX ór þam biscope, XII ór þam preoste, þe he of his circan asette, XII ór eallum geferan, 7 þolige þæs feos eac, gif he on unriht ænig for oðres preostes circan sealde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who did that wrong is to pay 20 ores to the bishop, 12 ores to the priest whom he ousted from his church, 12 ores to all the colleagues, and he is also to forfeit the money if he gave any wrongly for the church of another priest.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And he who committed that offence is to pay twenty ores to the bishop, twelve ores to the priest whom he displaced from his church, twelve ores to all of his colleagues, and he is also to forfeit the payment, if he paid anything wrongfully for another priest's church.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
